%% Payment: phát vé trước khi transaction hoàn tất
%% confirmPayment · đã khóa Booking, key mới, trạng thái pending
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as PaymentServiceImpl
    participant P1 as PaymentRepository
    participant P2 as TicketService
    Note over P0,P2: Transaction confirm: Booking CONFIRMED → BookingRepository.save
    Note over P0,P2: Payment SUCCESS; amount lấy Booking.totalAmount; không tăng tồn
    P0->>P1: save(payment)
    P1-->>P0: savedPayment; chưa kết luận commit
    P0->>P2: issueTicketsForBooking(booking)
    P2-->>P0: vé được tạo hoặc RuntimeException
    Note over P0,P2: Thành công → DTO/commit; lỗi unchecked → rollback booking/payment/tickets
